description:
Onicore is a FinTech company specializing in developing products for cryptocurrency operations.
👉 We are looking for an experienced specialist to join the backend team for a recent exchanger project (no legacy).
The latest technology, cool team, and the ability to influence product development are included.
Your skills:
• 5+ yrs as a Python backend developer;
• Multi-threading and asynchronous software development;
• Having knowledge and understanding of network principles (TCP / IP, DNS, HTTP, SSL);
• Database experience (PostgreSQL);
• Having knowledge of infrastructure principles, AWS Amazon cloud and Google Cloud;
• Experience with Git;
• Agile team working experience;
• Ukrainian language - fluent.
Would be a plus experience with:
- FastAPI;
- Blockchain and Cryptocurrencies;
- FinTech sphere;
- Telegram bots development.
What's in it for you?
🏥 Medical insurance
🤓 Paid courses, conferences, training sessions, workshops etc.
💂 English classes
💪 Sport compensation
💼 Legal assistance
🧗‍♂️ Motivated and goal-oriented team
🧑‍💻 Direct impact on the development of the product
💻 Corporate laptops
Feel free to ask any questions :)
